=='''General'''==
Eternity Milestones is the 1st {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} tab, unlocked by reaching {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} for the first time. This tab includes [[Eternity#Eternity_Bonuses|Eternity Bonuses]]. There are three types of Eternity Milestones: Eternities, Animals and Challenges.

=='''Eternities'''==
Eternity Milestones are obtained by reaching a certain number of {{Keyword|eternity|Eternities}} (Σ). These milestones unlock automation and new mechanics, modify existing mechanics, and provide boosts, as follows:
# Have 1 Σ : Unlocks Eternity Milestones
# Have 2 Σ : Starting from this {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity|}}, keeps all [[Automations|{{Keyword|auto|Automations}}]]
# Have 3 Σ : Unlocks Eternity Zoo (see [[Eternity#Animals|Animals]])
# Have 5 Σ : Buying [[Revolution|Revolutions]] (colors) no longer take away [[Revolution#Score|Score]]
# Have 7 Σ : Unlocks [[Automations#IP_Adjuster|{{Keyword|auto|Auto IP Adjuster}}]]
# Have 8 Σ : Unlocks [[Eternity#Eternity_Challenges|Eternity Challenges]]
# Have 12 Σ : Unlocks [[Automations#Autobuy_Infinity_Tree|{{Keyword|auto|Automation for Infinity Upgrades}}]]
# Have 14 Σ : Unlocks [[Automations#Autobuy_Generators|{{Keyword|auto|Automation for Generators}}]]
# Have 16 Σ : Unlocks [[Automations#Autobuy_Stars|{{Keyword|auto|Automation for Stars and Star/Stardust upgrades}}]] and [[Automations#Auto_Eternity|{{Keyword|auto|Auto Eternity}}]]
# Have 32 Σ : "Breaks Eternity" ([[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] is no longer limited to {{Keyword|ip|~1.79e308 IP}})
# Have 100 Σ : x1.05 to [[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] gain for each {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} (softcapped at 1,000 Σ)
[[File:Eternity milestones.png|thumb|Eternity Milestones]]
At 32 Σ, the player will Break Eternity ([[Achievements|{{Keyword|ach|Ach. 80}}]]), which removes the [[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] limit of {{Keyword|ip|~1.79e308 IP}}. Reaching higher [[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] values will reward more {{Keyword|ep|EP}} per {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}}.


=='''Animals'''==
Animals Milestones are obtained based on how many Animals the player owns.
They unlock new mechanics, modify existing mechanics and provide bonuses to the player, as follows:

# Own 1 Animal: Unlocks [[Eternity#Slowdown|Slowdown]]
# Own 4 Animals: Unlocks [[Automations#Auto_Slowdown|{{Keyword|auto|Auto Slowdown}}]]
# Own 7 Animals: Unlocks [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|Lab}}]]
# Own 10 Animals: [[Revolution#Promote|Promoting]] now resets nothing
# Own 20 Animals: Gain 100% of the {{Keyword|ip|IP}} you would get on [[Infinity|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}]], every second. ''Needs [[Eternity#Eternity_Challenges|Eternity Challenges Milestone]] 4 (10 {{Keyword|eternity|EC}} completions) to work fully.''
# Own 48 Animals: +10 free levels to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
# Own 81 Animals: Unlocks [[Eternity#Dilation_&_Dilation Tree|{{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}}]]

=='''Challenges'''==
{{Keyword|eternity|Eternity Challenges}} have their own milestones based on the number of EC completed.
#3 EC completions: Keep your [[Infinity#Infinity_Challenges|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity Challenges}}]] on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(including fastest completion times)''
#5 EC completions: [[Revolution#Prestige|Prestiging]] now resets nothing
#8 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Supernova|Supernova]]
#10 EC completions: Keep fastest [[Infinity|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}]] time on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(needed for [[Eternity#Animals_Milestones|Animals Milestone]] 5 to work correctly)''
#30 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives 1 free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#32 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives another free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#35 EC completions: Every 2 Supernovae gives another free level on all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#50 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Dilation_&_Dilation_Tree|{{Keyword|dtp|Dilation Tree}}]]
